gm-method (npm dep file-edit fix must be marker-gated or a fresh install loses it): a dependency FILE-EDIT fix (postinstall patch) regresses when a fresh or older npm install lands a version lacking it. Keep a marker-gated postinstall bridge until the consumed PUBLISHED tarball provably carries the fix -- grep the installed copy, not the source repo. A version bump in package.json does NOT mean your commit shipped to npm; verify the installed tarball contains the fix before removing the bridge.